<title>INDIA: SOCCER-IRAQ BEAT UZBEKISTAN IN NEHRU CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-IRAQ BEAT UZBEKISTAN IN NEHRU CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq beat Uzbekistan 3-1 (halftime 2-1) in the final of the Nehru Gold Cup soccer tournament on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Iraq - Husam Naji 5, Anatoly Kuralev own goal 20, Laith Hussain Shihab 60</p>
<p>Uzbekistan - Ravashanjon Mataliev 43</p>
</text>
